# The knowledge index is local, rebuilt, never merged (R14)
graphify-out/

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Generated study artifacts (per-corpus; also ignored inside their own dirs).
# NOT audio: generated media is committed by default (SF-17), and whether a
# corpus commits its own is that corpus's `media` policy (SF-02, SF-32), not a
# rule this repository gets to make on its behalf.
*.unit.html
*.section.html
site.json

# Generated audio and discovery caches produced by THIS repository's own runs.
# ⚠️ Scope, because the rule above and this one look contradictory and are not:
# a *corpus* commits its media by default (SF-17) under its own `media` policy
# (SF-02, SF-32), and that policy is written in the corpus's ignore file, not
# here. `studyforge`'s own tree never legitimately holds a clip or a scan
# cache — anything matching below came out of a local build or a test run.
*.audio/
.studyforge/
.discovery-cache/

# ⛔ ...except the golden fixtures, which are the expected output and are the
# whole point of FND-04. Without this, a fixture corpus's `site.json` and its
# `*.unit.html` goldens are silently untracked and the next agent's suite
# passes locally and fails everywhere else.
!tests/fixtures/**

# ⛔ An agent's own scratch directory (Ruling 139): a sweep's log, table,
# harness and mutant backups live under the worktree that produced them, never
# in the shared session scratchpad where two developers' `sweep.log` truncate
# each other (`W40/5`, `SK-05/6` — the same defect reported from both sides in
# one round). ⚠️ This line is what makes that clause safe rather than a trap:
# `tools.quality.config.text_files` reads everything git has NOT been told to
# ignore, on purpose — a file you have just written and not yet added is
# exactly what an R7 gate must catch — so without this entry the first agent
# to follow Ruling 139 reds the floor with its own pytest logs. ⛔ Measured at
# `8c8a434`: floor exit **1**, 108 findings, every one inside `.scratch/`.
.scratch/

# Editors / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
